// supersedes v3 (random_init mirror probe KICK WAVE 4 3/3 — random_init PPR_v3=0.5517
// > sft-1-8 0.4138 → V14 VIOLATED). v4 closes random_init leak via three concurrent gates:
//   Gate (A) C3.4 anchor floor 0.1176 → 0.20 (random_init v4_baseline c3_4 mean=0.091, max=0.186 ⇒ FAIL)
//   Gate (B) PPR scope restrict to v4_baseline axis only (n=14 evaluable; deep axes
//            identity/agency/phenomenal/temporal/social are length-confound ⇒ informational only)
//   Gate (C) PPR_v4 floor 0.25 → 0.40 (v4_baseline only)
//   Gate (D) MTRP (Minimum Trained-vs-Random PPR delta) ≥ 0.10 — every EMERGE claim
//            MUST attach paired random_init mirror probe of same arch family.
